// # sec/pqc — Post-Quantum Cryptography
//
// Logline: ML-KEM-768 (key encapsulation), ML-DSA-65 (digital signature), the PQ AEAD seal/open that binds ciphertexts to a keypair via pk-as-AAD, and the dudect constant-time test harness.
//
// Beats:
//   1. mlkem.c — ML-KEM-768 keygen/encaps/decaps.
//   2. mldsa.c — ML-DSA-65 keygen/sign/verify.
//   3. pq_sig.c — PQ AEAD seal/open with pk-as-AAD binding.
//   4. dudect_c_native.c — constant-time test util (moves to qa/ in a follow-up).
//
// ──▓▓ sec/pqc ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: PQC-by-default — first-class in the runtime ::
